'''Cake Machine''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[June Bride (Gacha Event)|June Bride]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]]. This unit is a variant of [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]] with various different attributes.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 756
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Cake Machine
|name2 = Wedding Cake Machine
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Wedding Cake Machine''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cake Machine is not too different from the original. It is by no means a generalist, though its [[Resistant|Resistance]] versus its targeted traits makes it a durable tank, which is further bolstered by its [[Weaken]] ability that has surprisingly decent uptime despite its low activation chance. Even Shielded Aku threats aren't exactly safe, as it also has a 75% chance to [[Shield Piercing|Pierce Shields]]. While the chances of both occurring simultaneously isn't too high, it can still buy some valuable time for other units.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Breaker}}

